        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our commercial potential could be reduced or eliminated if our competitors develop and commercialize products that are safer or more effective, have fewer or less-severe side effects, or are more convenient or less expensive than products that we may develop.",
