        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are focused on addressing the shortcomings of alpelisib and other first-generation PI3Kα inhibitors (e.g., inavolisib) by developing product candidates that target these genetic alterations selectively while sparing the wild-type PI3Kα.",
