        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We designed our current product candidates utilizing disciplined medicinal chemistry, x-ray crystallography and computational chemistry to inhibit specified mutated versions of phosphoinositide 3-kinase alpha (“PI3Kα”), a key disease creating gene.",
